            "s018_p": "A benefit that passes down",
            "s019_p": "Permanent residence or a second citizenship for 2–3 generations",
            "s020_p": "<span>Scroll to explore</span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">arrow_downward</span>",
            "s021_p": "<span class=\"immbds-bar\"></span><span class=\"immbds-etxt\">Why international real estate</span>",
            "s022_p": "Property abroad can produce regular income in a hard currency while acting as a store of value and spreading risk through portfolio diversification. Beyond the financial side, owning an asset in a market with clear property law — together with easier travel, the right of residence, or a fallback plan for the family — creates long-term value that goes beyond investment return alone.",
            "s023_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">01</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">account_balance</span>",
            "s024_p": "Diversify and protect your wealth",
            "s025_p": "Hold part of your wealth abroad, in a hard currency such as the US dollar or the euro.",
            "s026_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">02</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">payments</span>",
            "s027_p": "Income in hard currency",
            "s028_p": "Rental yields in these markets are generally in the 3–5% range, producing passive income; actual returns depend on the property and the market.",
            "s029_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">03</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">home_work</span>",
            "s030_p": "More options on where to live",
            "s031_p": "A second home abroad, and a fallback plan for the family.",
            "s032_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">04</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">school</span>",
            "s033_p": "Support for an international education",
            "s034_p": "A base for your children to study abroad, settle, and plan ahead.",
            "s035_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">05</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">public</span>",
            "s036_p": "Better international access",
            "s037_p": "More freedom to travel, study, work, and live abroad.",
            "s038_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">06</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">storefront</span>",
            "s039_p": "Room to grow a business",
            "s040_p": "More scope to set up a company, trade, and reach new markets.",
            "s041_p": "<span class=\"immbds-sp-num\">07</span><span class=\"immbds-sp-div\"></span><span class=\"immbds-ms\">beach_access</span>",
            "s042_p": "A vacation home, or somewhere to retire",
            "s043_p": "A place to vacation, or to settle in later life, abroad.",
